cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Inspectour in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Inspectour: interactive inspection of f0 contours through grouping and comparison"
abstract: >-
  A Shiny application for exploring normalised f0 trajectories without assuming
  categories in advance. Contours can be grouped, coloured, faceted, isolated
  and labelled interactively, supporting prosodic categorisation in fieldwork on
  under-described systems.
type: software
authors:
